subsections.(vii):
an "agreement" shall be construed as including any commitment or
arrangement, whether legally binding or not, and references to being party to an
agreement or having agreed to do anything shall be construed accordingly;

subsections.(viii):
any agreement or document shall be construed as a reference to that agreement
or document as amended, supplemented, restated, novated or replaced from
time to time;

subsections.(xi):
words in the singular shall be interpreted as including the plural and vice versa;
